  "notes": "{畏敬|いけい} expresses profound respect combined with awe.\n\nUSAGE:\n- {畏敬|いけい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to revere, to hold in awe (suru-verb)\n- {畏敬|いけい}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{念|ねん}→念：12766_nen⟧: a feeling of reverence/awe\n- {畏敬|いけい}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{念|ねん}→念：12766_nen⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{抱|いだ}く→抱く：02010_idaku⟧: to feel reverence\nCombines {畏|おそ}れ (fear, awe) and {敬|けい} (respect), expressing respect tinged with a sense of something greater than oneself.\n\nREGISTER:\nFormal and literary.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{尊敬|そんけい}→尊敬：01454_sonkei⟧: respect (more everyday)\n- ⟦{崇拝|すうはい}→崇拝：10032_suuhai⟧: worship\n- ⟦{敬意|けいい}→敬意：02781_keii⟧: respect, homage",
